{
 "file": "EN/EVENT_DATA/MESSAGE/E700/E717_011.BMD",
 "entries": [
  {
   "id": "MSG_000_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Hifumi",
   "en": "Yes...? Can I help you?",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "SEL_001_0_0#0",
   "speaker": null,
   "en": "Can you teach me shogi?",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "SEL_001_0_0#1",
   "speaker": null,
   "en": "Can I be your student?",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "SEL_001_0_0#2",
   "speaker": null,
   "en": "I want to be a pro.",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_002_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Hifumi",
   "en": "...Huh?",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_003_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Hifumi",
   "en": "...Huh?",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_004_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Hifumi",
   "en": "...Huh?",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_005_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Hifumi",
   "en": "Um, you don't necessarily have to[n]learn from me, you know...",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_005_0_0#1",
   "speaker": "Hifumi",
   "en": "There are other options... such as[n]playing online.",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_006_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Hifumi",
   "en": "...Sorry, I just can't.",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_007_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Hifumi",
   "en": "Well then...",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_008_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Hifumi",
   "en": "Um...",
   "uk": "Ем...",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_008_0_0#1",
   "speaker": "Hifumi",
   "en": "So... you like shogi?",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "SEL_009_0_0#0",
   "speaker": null,
   "en": "I admire you.",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "SEL_009_0_0#1",
   "speaker": null,
   "en": "I want to play like you.",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_010_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Hifumi",
   "en": "Huh...?",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_010_0_0#1",
   "speaker": "Hifumi",
   "en": "Oh, um... thank you very much.",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_011_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Hifumi",
   "en": "Like me...?",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_011_0_0#1",
   "speaker": "Hifumi",
   "en": "You're a bit strange... but thank you.",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_012_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Hifumi",
   "en": "Um...",
   "uk": "Ем...",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_013_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Hifumi",
   "en": "Okay, just a quick game then.[n]Twenty seconds per move...[n]If that's all right with you.",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "SEL_013_3_0#0",
   "speaker": null,
   "en": "I don't know how to play.",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "SEL_013_3_0#1",
   "speaker": null,
   "en": "Fine with me.",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MND_013_5_0#0",
   "speaker": null,
   "en": "...Saying that will likely make her[n]lose interest.",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MND_013_5_0#1",
   "speaker": null,
   "en": "I guess I'll have to play her.[n]I'll just move the pieces randomly...",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_013_7_0#0",
   "speaker": "Hifumi",
   "en": "...I'll start.",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_014_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Hifumi",
   "en": "...So this is your skill level, huh?",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_014_0_0#1",
   "speaker": "Hifumi",
   "en": "The dragon which governs the[n]blue sky has fallen into my hands.[n]How do you intend to survive this?",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_015_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Hifumi",
   "en": "Check!",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_016_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Hifumi",
   "en": "...It's checkmate no matter how you look at it.",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_016_0_0#1",
   "speaker": "Hifumi",
   "en": "Please concede.",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "SEL_017_0_0#0",
   "speaker": null,
   "en": "Concede?",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "SEL_017_0_0#1",
   "speaker": null,
   "en": "I can still keep going.",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_018_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Hifumi",
   "en": "To concede is an act of admitting[n]that you have lost, with grace.",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_018_0_0#1",
   "speaker": "Hifumi",
   "en": "If you aspire to become a shogi player,[n]I recommend that you take your study[n]of the game to heart. ",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_019_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Hifumi",
   "en": "Thank you for playing...",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_020_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Hifumi",
   "en": "Well then, that will be all for today...",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_021_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Hifumi",
   "en": "If it's all right with you, may I request[n]another match sometime?",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_021_3_0#0",
   "speaker": "Hifumi",
   "en": "I feel... a gambler's spirit emanating[n]from you.",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_021_3_0#1",
   "speaker": "Hifumi",
   "en": "Which is strange, since your style of[n]play is that of a complete novice...",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "SEL_021_5_0#0",
   "speaker": null,
   "en": "Sorry I'm a beginner.",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "SEL_021_5_0#1",
   "speaker": null,
   "en": "You were different too.",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_021_7_0#0",
   "speaker": "Hifumi",
   "en": "Huh...!?",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_021_7_0#1",
   "speaker": "Hifumi",
   "en": "Oh, I-I'm sorry...",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_022_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Hifumi",
   "en": "However, I will instruct you[n]under one condition...",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_022_0_0#1",
   "speaker": "Hifumi",
   "en": "You become my playing partner so[n]that I can research new moves.[n]Is that agreeable?",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "SEL_023_0_0#0",
   "speaker": null,
   "en": "Sounds good to me.",
   "uk": "Як на мене, непогано.",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "SEL_023_0_0#1",
   "speaker": null,
   "en": "Bring it on!",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "SEL_023_0_0#2",
   "speaker": null,
   "en": "I'm scared...",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_024_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Hifumi",
   "en": "Thank you very much...",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_025_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Hifumi",
   "en": "That's precious.",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_026_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Hifumi",
   "en": "I'm not going to hold back...",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_027_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Hifumi",
   "en": "Well then, it's a deal. I'll teach you how[n]to play, and you'll assist me with my new[n]moves.",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MND_990_0_0#0",
   "speaker": null,
   "en": "I've made a deal with Hifumi...",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_027_4_0#0",
   "speaker": "Sae",
   "en": "I think that quite advanced strategies[n]are necessary to succeed at that many[n]criminal acts.",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_027_5_0#0",
   "speaker": "Sae",
   "en": "And yours weren't by the wit of an[n]amateur. You had a professional who[n]regularly deals with such tactics.",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_027_6_0#0",
   "speaker": "Sae",
   "en": "...You have an idea on who that is,[n]don't you!?",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_027_7_0#0",
   "speaker": "Igor",
   "en": "You have agreed to a new contract.[n]Excellent.",
   "uk": "Ви погодилися на новий контракт.[n]Чудово.",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_027_8_0#0",
   "speaker": "Igor",
   "en": "Your ability to manage your team[n]members shall increase through[n]this new bond of yours.",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_028_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Hifumi",
   "en": "...Now, let's get into today's lesson...",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_029_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Hifumi",
   "en": "...Okay, let's end here for today.",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  }
 ]
}